WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.390
You've already paid for the cameras.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.790
So who's actually watching them?

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:09.700
SIG Eagle Eye plugs into the cameras you already have,

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:12.890
and turns the footage into something you can act on.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.650
First, it watches the zones you choose, for the rules you agreed.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.050
Never toilets or change rooms.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.240
Then every event is sorted the way labour law sorts it.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.350
A real person reviews every flag.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.540
Until someone decides, nothing happens.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.860
Confirmed incidents become a clear record:

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:38.140
the rule, the clip, and who decided what.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.230
Eagle Eye never disciplines anyone.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.720
You decide what happens next, with a fair procedure.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.790
Problems caught early.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.600
Fair to honest staff.

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.880
And a record you can defend.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.680
SIG Eagle Eye.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.220
Sign up today.
